               </termList>
            </classification>
            <itemList xml:id="itemList_02e33819">
               <item label="" xml:id="item_d1e156153">
                  <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_56437a92">
                     <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_7d1b2dd4">In a modern nineteenth century library half-binding with brown marbled hard covers with red label (title) pasted on front cover. Paper of a good, dense quality; on the margins strips of paper have been pasted in order to make it the same format as the other text books (from 4<rend xml:id="idm120" rend="sup">o</rend> to 2<rend xml:id="idm121" rend="sup">o</rend>) with which the work has been bound.</physMedium>
